  title: Rohillas
  text: Afghan Rohillas settled in Rohilkhand, in western Uttar Pradesh, in the 18th century under leaders such as Ali Muhammad Khan and Hafiz Rahmat Khan. They were defeated by Awadh with British help in 1774.
